prompt:
Read the memory records and produce a concise summary plus reusable skill cards.
Rules: - Output ONLY SUMMARY= lines and SKILL | lines. - SUMMARY= contains one paragraph per line. - SKILL | ID=sk_1 | TITLE=... | INSTRUCTION=... | TAGS=... - TAGS use ';' separators. - Do NOT use " | " inside any value. - Skill IDs are temporary (sk_1...); the system remaps them later. - Skip trivial records. Merge duplicates. Do not invent facts. - Keep the original language.
Existing summary: ${existingSummary}
Memory records: ${recordsText} ${extraInstructions}
